			"notes": "Chromatic Subtitles 2.2.0 adds NeoForge support, with dedicated Fabric and NeoForge builds for Minecraft 26.1.2 and 26.3.\n\n### Added\n- NeoForge support for Minecraft 26.1.2 and 26.3.\n- Dedicated Fabric and NeoForge builds for each supported Minecraft version.\n\n### Changed\n- Reworked the build with Stonecutter and Architectury Loom.\n- Client initialization and config handling are now loader-neutral. The config path is unchanged: `config/chromaticsubtitles.toml`.\n\n### Notes\n- Minecraft 26.2 is not included in this release; use 2.1.0+26.2 for 26.2.\n- No gameplay or config format changes.\n\n### Downloads\n\n| Minecraft | Fabric | NeoForge |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 26.1.2 | `chromaticsubtitles-fabric-2.2.0+26.1.2.jar` | `chromaticsubtitles-neoforge-2.2.0+26.1.2.jar` |\n| 26.3 | `chromaticsubtitles-fabric-2.2.0+26.3.jar` | `chromaticsubtitles-neoforge-2.2.0+26.3.jar` |\n\nSource jars are attached as well."
		},
